{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06755","headline":"留别岑参兄弟 · 王昌龄","name":"留别岑参兄弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江城建业楼，山尽沧海头。\n副职守兹县，东南櫂孤舟。\n长安故人宅，秣马经前秋。\n便以风雪暮，还爲纵饮留。\n貂蝉七叶贵，鸿鹄万里游。\n何必念钟鼎，所在烹肥牛。\n爲君啸一曲，且莫弹箜篌。\n徒见枯者艳，谁言直如钩。\n岑家双琼树，腾光难爲俦。\n谁言青门悲，俯期吴山幽。\n日西石门峤，月吐金陵洲。\n追随探灵怪，岂不骄王侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06755.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06755","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}